QNX change from QNX's aports (core/binutils/0010.patch).

Taken from qnx-ports/aports core/binutils -- the APKBUILD the QNX Everywhere 8.0.4r1
image's package is built from.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

From b93b29df22d7a90244896968decb4343f5ef625b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Sleeth <jsleeth@blackberry.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Oct 2024 21:42:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bdf-ld : custom linker script null derefence

check the bed before using it.

CLT-9353
---
diff --git a/bfd/elflink.c b/bfd/elflink.c
index a180e59e8ca..9af3d4db7bd 100644
--- a/bfd/elflink.c
+++ b/bfd/elflink.c
@@ -64,7 +64,7 @@ _bfd_elf_link_keep_memory (struct bfd_link_info *info)
      this is opt-in by each backend.  */
   const struct elf_backend_data *bed
     = get_elf_backend_data (info->output_bfd);
-  if (bed->use_mmap)
+  if (bed && (bed->use_mmap))
     return false;
 #endif
   bfd *abfd;

